<title>USA: ARI Network provides system to Pharmacia &amp; Upjohn.</title>
<headline>ARI Network provides system to Pharmacia &amp; Upjohn.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>ARI Network Services Inc said Monday it will provide an automated sales management software system to the Animal Health Division of Pharmacia &amp; Upjohn Inc.</p>
<p>The so-called ARISE system will allow the Animal Health unit to capture and share sales data through an Internet-enabled system. Financial terms of the agreement were not announced.</p>
<p>ARI Network Services provides Internet-enabled electronic commerce and data management services in addition to managing commerce databases.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
